WEBVTT

00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:33.250
Koku!

00:00:34.540 --> 00:00:38.260
Where have you been?
I've been waiting so long.

00:01:18.750 --> 00:01:19.920
Yuna.

00:01:26.430 --> 00:01:27.850
Yuna!

00:01:28.520 --> 00:01:30.270
Give her back!

00:01:37.110 --> 00:01:38.320
You know what to do?

00:01:38.320 --> 00:01:41.150
We just need to avoid his heart
and head, right?

00:02:04.550 --> 00:02:05.970
Yuna.

00:03:21.880 --> 00:03:22.840
Are they ready?

00:03:22.840 --> 00:03:24.220
Just give the word.

00:04:04.710 --> 00:04:06.220
Give back Yuna!

00:04:06.960 --> 00:04:08.430
Give her back!

00:04:11.510 --> 00:04:12.760
You're so pathetic.

00:04:14.050 --> 00:04:14.770
Haul them up.

00:05:01.680 --> 00:05:02.820
Minatsuki!

00:05:13.490 --> 00:05:15.750
Stop! Don't kill him.

00:05:18.210 --> 00:05:20.200
Minatsuki, we need to withdraw.

00:05:20.200 --> 00:05:23.380
If it's not treated immediately,
it'll become irreversible.

00:05:24.080 --> 00:05:26.550
Minatsuki! Hey! Are you listening to me?

00:05:27.220 --> 00:05:29.140
Minatsuki! Minatsuki!

00:05:39.810 --> 00:05:40.810
Canopus.

00:05:45.770 --> 00:05:46.690
Koku!

00:05:47.190 --> 00:05:48.490
Are you all right?

00:06:16.220 --> 00:06:19.850
To my son, Keith

00:06:20.980 --> 00:06:25.820
Will sense the part of me within you.

00:06:27.650 --> 00:06:29.530
He will find his way to you

00:06:30.910 --> 00:06:34.490
Please guide him

00:07:04.470 --> 00:07:06.520
Whose fault is it that we lost?

00:07:07.270 --> 00:07:08.610
Yeah, whose?

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:11.530
Weaklings like you don't belong here!

00:07:12.320 --> 00:07:13.240
Who threw that?

00:07:15.990 --> 00:07:17.450
Leave Yuna alone!

00:07:24.660 --> 00:07:25.920
You see?

00:07:25.920 --> 00:07:29.050
The instant Yuna starts crying,
he comes running.

00:07:29.050 --> 00:07:30.050
You're right!

00:07:31.540 --> 00:07:32.630
So cool!

00:07:32.630 --> 00:07:35.340
Come to my rescue, sir knight!

00:07:56.190 --> 00:07:58.740
Kirisame
and the other boys carried you in.

00:07:59.280 --> 00:08:01.330
Be sure to thank them later.

00:08:08.660 --> 00:08:10.790
They're always making fun of us.

00:08:12.540 --> 00:08:13.630
Is that so?

00:08:14.250 --> 00:08:15.340
I don't get it.

00:08:16.130 --> 00:08:17.720
Everyone is so strong,

00:08:18.260 --> 00:08:22.050
but all I have is my left eye,
and I'm not supposed to use it.

00:08:22.640 --> 00:08:24.600
What am I even doing here?

00:08:25.390 --> 00:08:26.350
Koku.

00:08:27.180 --> 00:08:32.690
Having superior physical abilities
or special powers doesn't make you strong.

00:08:33.270 --> 00:08:36.020
I've told you this before.

00:08:36.020 --> 00:08:39.580
Grown-ups all say stuff like that.
It's nothing but pretty words.

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:42.530
You have to be strong to protect people.

00:08:44.120 --> 00:08:46.450
I suppose you might be right about that.

00:08:47.160 --> 00:08:49.920
But then again,
it might just be that you aren't.

00:08:50.960 --> 00:08:53.540
Well, you'll probably understand one day.

00:08:54.750 --> 00:08:57.630
But for now,
it's important to ponder such things.

00:09:06.760 --> 00:09:07.520
Thanks.

00:09:09.140 --> 00:09:11.230
You helped me out earlier, remember?

00:09:11.770 --> 00:09:14.190
Yeah... I did. And?

00:09:14.940 --> 00:09:15.770
And?

00:09:16.110 --> 00:09:17.990
That's all?
That's all.

00:09:18.980 --> 00:09:21.450
You could have said that at school!

00:09:22.030 --> 00:09:24.240
You didn't have to drag me out here.

00:09:24.450 --> 00:09:27.990
We'll be teased again
if we're seen together at school, right?

00:09:27.990 --> 00:09:29.330
Nobody teases me!

00:09:30.290 --> 00:09:34.290
Tell me,
why do you keep trying to help me?

00:09:34.920 --> 00:09:37.710
Why? Can't you tell?

00:09:39.710 --> 00:09:44.430
I don't know why, but when you feel sad,
I feel something, too.

00:09:44.970 --> 00:09:45.930
That's why.

00:09:45.930 --> 00:09:48.100
You do it to protect me, you mean?

00:09:48.430 --> 00:09:49.270
Is that weird?

00:09:55.190 --> 00:09:57.110
Then I'll protect you, too.

00:09:58.230 --> 00:10:01.990
Whenever you're feeling sad,
I'll put a smile on your face.

00:10:07.360 --> 00:10:08.540
I had a great idea.

00:10:09.780 --> 00:10:10.540
Look at this.

00:10:12.790 --> 00:10:15.210
All of us here have special numbers.

00:10:17.040 --> 00:10:17.880
You're "four."

00:10:18.540 --> 00:10:20.550
But not the normal "four."

00:10:20.960 --> 00:10:23.380
You're a special four
that's only for you.

00:10:23.590 --> 00:10:25.770
One that's only used for time.

00:10:26.510 --> 00:10:27.720
And I'm "13."

00:10:28.640 --> 00:10:30.480
And if you combine them...

00:10:32.430 --> 00:10:34.520
Let's use this as our special signal.

00:10:35.230 --> 00:10:38.490
Next time you're being teased,
draw this where I'll see it.

00:10:39.020 --> 00:10:42.400
And then I'll come running and help you!

00:10:42.980 --> 00:10:46.830
And when I draw it, you come and help me!

00:10:47.820 --> 00:10:50.540
'Kay. But will you really come?

00:10:50.990 --> 00:10:51.830
Of course!

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:53.910
And I'll come for sure, too!

00:10:55.830 --> 00:10:57.010
Hold yours out, too.

00:11:01.670 --> 00:11:02.430
Promise!

00:11:20.480 --> 00:11:21.200
Yuna!

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:31.040
Yuna!

00:11:31.490 --> 00:11:32.330
Koku?

00:11:32.700 --> 00:11:33.540
Yuna!

00:11:33.990 --> 00:11:35.000
Kirisame.

00:11:35.830 --> 00:11:39.960
Take Koku to this place
instead of the shelter.

00:11:40.670 --> 00:11:42.630
No one else knows about it.

00:11:43.210 --> 00:11:44.380
You'll be safe there.

00:11:51.430 --> 00:11:52.260
Koku?

00:11:54.010 --> 00:11:55.520
What are you doing here?

00:11:55.850 --> 00:11:57.890
Go with Kirisame. Hurry.

00:11:57.890 --> 00:11:58.980
But Yuna is--

00:11:59.640 --> 00:12:03.110
I know. I'll do what I can for Yuna.

00:12:03.480 --> 00:12:04.300
So get moving!

00:12:04.300 --> 00:12:04.820
But-

00:12:07.030 --> 00:12:09.990
Kirisame, keep Koku safe no matter what.

00:12:22.080 --> 00:12:25.380
Koku, where are you? I'm scared!

00:12:28.840 --> 00:12:29.680
Yuna!

00:12:31.630 --> 00:12:32.470
Koku!

00:12:44.360 --> 00:12:46.530
Who are you?

00:12:47.020 --> 00:12:47.990
I'm Minatsuki.

00:12:48.980 --> 00:12:50.530
Koku is my little brother.

00:12:51.650 --> 00:12:52.490
Come with me.

00:12:53.530 --> 00:12:55.000
It's not safe here anymore.

00:12:56.240 --> 00:12:57.540
Koku's waiting for us.

00:12:58.580 --> 00:12:59.750
He is?

00:13:11.340 --> 00:13:12.180
Yuna!

00:13:12.720 --> 00:13:13.890
Keep moving!

00:13:14.550 --> 00:13:16.050
But Yuna might...

00:13:16.050 --> 00:13:19.100
If anything happens,
we have to go to the shelter.

00:13:19.350 --> 00:13:21.350
I'm sure everybody's there!

00:13:21.350 --> 00:13:23.270
Yuna will catch up, so come on!

00:13:23.690 --> 00:13:24.520
'Kay.

00:13:35.910 --> 00:13:37.670
Minatsuki! Izanami!

00:13:38.160 --> 00:13:39.790
You're safe? Thank goodness!

00:13:41.500 --> 00:13:45.210
Get to the shelter right away.
The enemy's closing in, so--

00:13:50.840 --> 00:13:52.720
So it was you people all along...

00:13:53.420 --> 00:13:54.680
Market Maker.

00:13:58.680 --> 00:13:59.520
You're...

00:14:07.650 --> 00:14:08.400
Minatsuki.

00:14:10.650 --> 00:14:11.780
You're the devil.

00:14:18.910 --> 00:14:21.580
I will never become his spare parts.

00:14:24.870 --> 00:14:27.630
So that rumor really was true, then?

00:14:29.340 --> 00:14:30.170
Where's Koku?

00:14:31.300 --> 00:14:33.010
Don't let him deceive you.

00:14:33.380 --> 00:14:35.890
Minatsuki, he's--

00:14:38.050 --> 00:14:39.600
Goodbye, Canopus.

00:14:49.520 --> 00:14:50.280
Almost there!

00:14:54.900 --> 00:14:55.620
Is this it?

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:56.460
Yeah.

00:15:04.080 --> 00:15:05.420
I'll hold them off here!

00:15:05.870 --> 00:15:07.410
Lock yourself inside!

00:15:07.410 --> 00:15:07.920
But-

00:15:07.920 --> 00:15:08.420
Koku!

00:15:09.290 --> 00:15:11.550
Listen, you're our king!

00:15:12.250 --> 00:15:14.100
You mustn't die here!

00:15:14.920 --> 00:15:15.760
Kirisame.

00:15:16.050 --> 00:15:18.220
I'll be right behind you!

00:15:18.220 --> 00:15:19.050
No!

00:15:19.430 --> 00:15:20.560
Kirisame, come with me!

00:15:20.890 --> 00:15:22.270
No more talk! Get moving!

00:15:25.850 --> 00:15:26.980
Koku! Run!

00:15:31.770 --> 00:15:33.030
I'll see you soon.

00:15:33.030 --> 00:15:34.450
Just wait in there.

00:16:06.930 --> 00:16:07.770
Yuna.

00:16:08.640 --> 00:16:09.530
I'm sorry!

00:16:13.480 --> 00:16:14.240
Koku?

00:16:17.440 --> 00:16:18.280
Yuna?

00:16:20.240 --> 00:16:21.160
Yuna!

00:16:21.910 --> 00:16:22.990
Yuna!

00:16:24.070 --> 00:16:24.950
Yuna!

00:16:26.830 --> 00:16:27.860
Yuna!

00:16:27.860 --> 00:16:28.300
Koku?

00:16:30.540 --> 00:16:31.590
Is that you, Koku?

00:16:32.620 --> 00:16:33.460
Canopus!

00:16:36.880 --> 00:16:38.470
Thank goodness you're safe.

00:16:42.180 --> 00:16:43.930
You have to get away from here.

00:16:44.180 --> 00:16:45.770
I can't. I can't do that!

00:16:46.430 --> 00:16:48.600
I can't run and leave everyone else!

00:16:49.430 --> 00:16:50.270
Koku.

00:16:51.690 --> 00:16:53.940
You have a duty to survive.

00:16:54.770 --> 00:16:56.490
You owe it to the others.

00:17:06.330 --> 00:17:07.130
What is it?

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:11.330
Everything you need to know about yourself
is on these pages.

00:17:12.080 --> 00:17:14.340
As well as what you must do next.

00:17:15.750 --> 00:17:17.550
Now, get going.

00:17:22.360 --> 00:17:23.140
Koku!

00:17:25.300 --> 00:17:27.350
You're able to resonate with Yuna.

00:17:28.760 --> 00:17:31.480
Find her and protect her no matter what.

00:17:45.360 --> 00:17:46.040
Keith.

00:17:47.660 --> 00:17:52.210
That boy will find his way to you.

00:17:56.040 --> 00:17:58.340
Guide him.

00:18:44.590 --> 00:18:45.590
Koku.

00:18:48.930 --> 00:18:49.850
Don't be afraid.

00:18:52.220 --> 00:18:54.570
I'll protect him.

00:18:56.480 --> 00:18:57.820
Be brave.

00:18:59.280 --> 00:19:03.030
Assimilate them into yourself
and become the black-winged king.

00:19:05.650 --> 00:19:08.120
As long as you and Yuna remain alive,

00:19:09.110 --> 00:19:12.700
their memories will carry on
through the ages.

00:19:15.120 --> 00:19:15.680
Wake up.

00:19:15.680 --> 00:19:16.370
Get up.

00:19:16.370 --> 00:19:17.600
Our king.

00:19:17.600 --> 00:19:18.960
The time has come.

00:19:27.590 --> 00:19:28.980
You took quite a beating.

00:19:29.680 --> 00:19:31.940
Don't push yourself yet. Get some sleep.

00:19:33.930 --> 00:19:36.560
I'll make coffee later
Oh, I can't yet.

00:19:36.560 --> 00:19:37.280
My pants.

00:19:39.350 --> 00:19:42.690
They're here,
but they're way too torn up to wear.

00:19:43.070 --> 00:19:44.900
My pants pocket.

00:19:44.900 --> 00:19:45.570
Pocket?

00:19:50.570 --> 00:19:53.660
I'm glad you said something
before I threw these out.

00:19:53.660 --> 00:19:54.330
That day,

00:19:55.740 --> 00:19:59.260
I chose to block every memory I had
except for those of Yuna.

00:20:00.670 --> 00:20:01.800
My left eye...

00:20:02.580 --> 00:20:04.710
has the ability to manipulate memories.

00:20:07.510 --> 00:20:09.930
I was always told
never to use it on others.

00:20:10.840 --> 00:20:13.770
So, I rewrote my own memories.

00:20:14.810 --> 00:20:17.360
To avoid the feelings of guilt
for what I did.

00:20:18.390 --> 00:20:23.320
But when I looked in her eyes,
I remembered everything.

00:20:30.280 --> 00:20:32.080
You still haven't found him?

00:20:33.200 --> 00:20:35.960
All precincts are currently cooperating
to conduct an exhaustive search.

00:20:38.040 --> 00:20:42.970
I authorized Keith Flick's return because
you said you'd take full responsibility.

00:20:43.830 --> 00:20:45.010
I can offer no excuse.

00:20:45.500 --> 00:20:47.670
Enough. I'll give you 24 hours.

00:20:48.380 --> 00:20:50.090
Locate Flick within that time.

00:20:50.880 --> 00:20:53.640
If you fail,
the RIS will be immediately disbanded.

00:20:54.510 --> 00:20:55.270
Is that clear?

00:21:06.820 --> 00:21:11.330
It's entirely possible that
he's deliberately slowing down the search.

00:21:12.070 --> 00:21:15.660
But this will force his hand
and make him genuinely apply himself.

00:21:16.490 --> 00:21:19.290
You see,
the RIS means more than anything to him.

00:21:20.620 --> 00:21:23.090
Someone else would take over the manhunt,
of course,

00:21:23.620 --> 00:21:26.590
but if anyone is going to locate Flick,
it's that man.

00:21:27.710 --> 00:21:31.600
I've created access rights
for you to read his and his team's files.

00:21:32.130 --> 00:21:34.100
Please make free use of our system.

00:21:36.010 --> 00:21:37.390
That will be helpful.

00:21:40.810 --> 00:21:41.980
You told us!

00:21:42.770 --> 00:21:44.310
That we're imitation gods!

00:21:44.850 --> 00:21:47.280
Meant to be sacrificed
to prevent his destruction.

00:21:47.860 --> 00:21:50.830
That no one could harm us
except the black-winged king!

00:21:57.280 --> 00:21:59.330
Why? Why did this happen?

00:22:03.710 --> 00:22:04.760
Stop!

00:22:13.880 --> 00:22:18.390
You're the one true prophet, the only one
who managed to decipher the inscription!

00:22:20.720 --> 00:22:25.360
The one and only person who knows the past
and can foresee the future!

00:22:26.190 --> 00:22:29.190
Aren't you the one
who was to lead us to the new world?

00:22:31.570 --> 00:22:32.530
Aren't you?

00:22:35.780 --> 00:22:38.870
Why? Why don't you answer me?

00:22:42.040 --> 00:22:42.830
Regulus.
